{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1755302400, "end_date": 1755993599, "month_true_total": 213, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:55:37 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "202747425", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851795021", "personaname": "XL_Mikael", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198851795021/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3837, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2464, "last_played": 1786969254, "avatar": "5e6b3f5b47a379852e5af745106b91f0720a8c84"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's damn near perfect.", "timestamp_created": 1755988990, "timestamp_updated": 1755988990, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202739140", "author": {"steamid": "76561198351154173", "personaname": "Magnus", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MagnusDerg/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2602, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 883, "last_played": 1783372974, "avatar": "13e8a100d1d3155e4812f7de27dcddda7b34968a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think the gunplay feels so good. All the guns are not too hard to use, not too much recoil or unpredictability, all of them do pretty adequate damage, no matter what guns feel good. My go-tos were the bandito and dual vipers, and usually precision rifle styles. I think the difficulty is pretty good even on standard. I do think map navigation can be a bit hard, like routing to specific areas i wasnt able to commit to memory after about 14 hours and sometimes use guides to help with that. \r\n\r\nUpgrading weapons seems to be satisfying as well, not really many bad things a weapon can have. I think a bit more randomness and enemy variety could be good since the maps seem pretty static. \r\n\r\nOverall I think one of the best FPS roguelikes you can play.", "timestamp_created": 1755979214, "timestamp_updated": 1755979214, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202738795", "author": {"steamid": "76561198095009261", "personaname": "❤ Sparx ❤", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/EdamCheese/", "num_games_owned": 195, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 2026, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1871, "last_played": 1756152262, "avatar": "90993aadad709637d1674fc8c57a73aa1695cbb0"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dead cells meets doom, very fun", "timestamp_created": 1755978841, "timestamp_updated": 1755978841, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.479452043771743774", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202737980", "author": {"steamid": "76561198394065156", "personaname": "ByFaKii", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/byfakii/", "num_games_owned": 165, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 4673, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4645, "deck_playtime_at_review": 155, "last_played": 1756575532, "avatar": "929a8b43066722d8f75670e07f23b67cf57c505a"}, "language": "english", "review": "After 100%ing the game, all i can do is praise the creator